<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Transcend prices at $10.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Transcend prices at $10.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	Transcend Therapeutics Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $10</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $10 - $12</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			1,800,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	    Everen Securities</p>
<p>NOTE: The proposed number of shares for the planned initial public offering in Transcend Therapeutics Inc was lowered to 1.8 million shares, from 2.455 million shares previously.</p>
<p>Transcend filed for a $26 million IPO last August with Vector Securities, which was subsequently pulled. In March, it refiled to raise the same amount but said Boehringer Ingelheim International GmbH would buy $5 million of the IPO shares as part of a licensing pact. That IPO, of two million shares to price at $12 to $14 each, was also postponed. Boehringer is the company's partner in a procysteine development program.</p>
</text>
